{"id":"n71478-3-5","stage":2,"title":"털다 · 洗劫一空","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71478-3-5-1","ko":"어제 뉴스 봤어? 은행을 턴 강도들이 붙잡혔대.","zh":"昨天看新闻了吗？听说抢银行的劫匪被抓了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뉴스","meaning":"新闻，新事件","explanation":"뉴스：新闻，新事件","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"2","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"(做)过","explanation":"보다：(做)过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"은행을","meaning":"银行","explanation":"은행：银行；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"은행","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71109","senseId":"1","lemma":"은행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"턴","meaning":"洗劫一空，抢劫、盗窃","explanation":"털다：洗劫一空，抢劫、盗窃；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"털다","audio":"/audio/770c0f63b3cf82e07986.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71478","senseId":"3","lemma":"털다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강도들이","meaning":"强盗","explanation":"강도：强盗；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강도","audio":"/audio/7866fc07b935f9a4a66b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91524","senseId":"1","lemma":"강도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙잡혔대.","meaning":"(人、动物等)被抓住","explanation":"붙잡히다：(人、动物等)被抓住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"붙잡히다","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25658","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻，新事件","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"初次被公开的新消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"(做)过","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示经历过前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"9630c6227715da13","term":"은행","zh":"银行","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3","entryId":"71109","definition":"负责管理人们的钱并把钱借给需要的人的机构。","pronunciation":["은행"]},{"id":"770c0f63b3cf82e0","term":"털다","zh":"洗劫一空，抢劫、盗窃","audio":"/audio/770c0f63b3cf82e07986.mp3","entryId":"71478","definition":"偷偷进入保管物品的地方，把东西全部抢走或偷走。","pronunciation":["털ː다"]},{"id":"7866fc07b935f9a4","term":"강도","zh":"强盗","audio":"/audio/7866fc07b935f9a4a66b.mp3","entryId":"91524","definition":"用施暴或胁迫的方式抢夺别人财物的盗贼。","pronunciation":["강ː도"]},{"id":"8bdcf9dae64d4cee","term":"붙잡히다","zh":"(人、动物等)被抓住","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3","entryId":"25658","definition":"逃跑的对象被捉住。","pronunciation":["붇짜피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69e5f05892c70dd47285.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71478-3-5-2","ko":"그것 참 다행이군.","zh":"那可真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그것","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다행이군.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","